because raw data is often
not usable nationally.

00:49:36.960 --> 00:49:40.623
So it depends on the systems
that trusts are using.

00:49:41.730 --> 00:49:43.200
- So mixed but more to do.

00:49:43.200 --> 00:49:45.300
- Mixed but more.

