02:03:47.040 --> 02:03:48.090
but to thank you all,

02:03:48.090 --> 02:03:50.427
we've been going from early this morning

02:03:50.427 --> 02:03:52.500
and all day with barely a break.

02:03:52.500 --> 02:03:55.473
So I appreciate the commitment,

02:03:57.614 --> 02:03:58.980
and yeah, the commitment,

02:03:58.980 --> 02:04:00.120
I'll leave it there.

02:04:00.120 --> 02:04:01.620
Thank you very much everybody,

02:04:01.620 --> 02:04:04.857
